# Normalize line endings on checkin, check out LF everywhere (fix-plan
# 4.5 / audit 07-F42's neighbor finding: `.gitignore` had carried a
# UTF-16 tail — see its own history — since a past commit on a Windows
# checkout with autocrlf mis-set). This is the repo-wide guard so a
# single misconfigured client can't reintroduce a CRLF- or UTF-16-
# encoded text file the way `.gitignore` was.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never subject to text normalization or diffing.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
